oy targets to progress to the next level of enlightenment. In this VR experience immersive gameplay is rewarded with innovative immersive cut scenes that push the boundaries of visual storytelling.", "short_description": "Beyond Hirieth merges space shooter gameplay with a sci fi thriller narrative."}]}, "developer_name": "Willem Kokke, Kris Kelly", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.enteryes.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.enteryes.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Enter Yes LTD", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.enteryes.com/", "category": "EARLY_ACCESS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "EXPLORATION", "NARRATIVE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "361121258836808"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386356_160920087964765_3092685287038386176_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H7ghZJSgYP0Q7kNvwGLFlvO&_nc_oc=AdlZPtyDIuqUWOjHK9Oh9W6-KpvM81naimaBLM4YnBzF28-kmFKD2bs4WS49KupYV1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuSsGHVgnV0wbJYvXPJQF2oT91wzdodHOT92TjLDy9T0A&oe=699995FA"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Beyond Hirieth", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1518022095, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1980273601987714", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_st